<title>USA: BZW names media coverage officer.</title>
<headline>BZW names media coverage officer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW, global investment division of Barclays Bank Plc, named Michael Bloom as director, investment banking services coverage officer.</p>
<p>Bloom, 35, would be responsible for origination in the media and communications sector. He was most recently coverage officer at Toronto Dominion, covering cellular, cable, TV programming, radio and publishing.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
